package teavm;

/**
 * Pre-rendered Bravura symbol centroid ratios, dumped on desktop Java
 * with the real Bravura font (see teavm-fork/phase-font/
 * SymbolMetricsDump.java + symbol-metrics.json). Generated by
 * phase-font/gen_symbol_metrics.py — do not edit by hand.
 *
 * For each shape, the centroidOffset ratios (mass centre of the
 * rendered symbol image, relative to area centre) that Audiveris
 * computes from the STANDARD_INTERLINE image (size 80). The patched
 * ShapeSymbol.computeCentroidOffset (ROUND 15) returns these instead
 * of rendering a (blank, under the stub font) image and dividing 0/0.
 * The table is exact: a manual mass-centre computation from
 * buildImage at size 80 reproduces the stored ratios with error
 * 0.0000 for every shape. Only Bravura is covered; other families
 * return null and fall back to the original image computation.
 */
